# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local scratch. Machine-readable results under results/ ARE tracked; raw
# per-run pipeline output folders are not.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
scratch/
tmp/
temp/
build/
preview/
*.tmp
title_preview*
slides/
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Internal working documents. These are kept in the local paper/ working folder
# but are deliberately NOT published in this repository: author-query trackers,
# development provenance records, and agent/task instruction documents.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
ACTION_REQUIRED.md
TUNING_PROVENANCE.md
REAL_CROP_FACTS.md
EVALUATION_LOCK.md
filaseg_comprehensive_next_actions.md
filaseg_todolist.md
comparator_study_brief.md
filaseg_lowdensity_brief.md
filaseg_lowdensity_prompt.md
CLAUDE.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# docs/ is local working documentation (feasibility notes, reproducibility
# scratch, internal handoff records, slide decks) and is not published in
# this repository; nothing in main.tex or supplementary.tex reads from it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
docs/
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Exploratory studies. Self-contained investigations that inform decisions but
# are not part of the manuscript: raw comparator outputs, downloaded third-party
# binaries, sweep scratch and per-study figures/tables. Each study folder keeps
# its own README and memo, which are the parts a human reads; nothing here is
# cited by main.tex and none of it is a build input.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
exploration/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw data must never enter the manuscript repository.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
input/
output/
raw_results/
sandbox/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Guard rails: pipeline source lives in the coding repository
#   https://github.com/Jorallan/FilaSeg
# and must never be copied here. paper/sync_to_paper_repo.sh already uses an
# explicit allow-list; these rules make an accidental bulk copy a no-op.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/1.stringart/
/2.preprocess/
/3.reconnect/
/4.postprocess/
/Tools/
/tests/
/eval/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Untracked record of measurements that were removed from the manuscript
# because the code that produced them no longer exists. Kept locally for
# future reference; not published.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
notes/depth_rule_transcribed_measurements.md
